    { "match": ["集成 / 应用连接器", "Integrations / Application Connectors"], "terms": ["连接器", "集成", "应用连接", "notion", "crm", "mcp", "api", "connector", "integration", "integrate"] },
    { "match": ["组织与存储", "Organization and Storage"], "terms": ["组织", "存储", "organization", "storage"] },
    { "match": ["成员席位与 Agent 槽位", "Member Seats and Agent Slots"], "terms": ["席位", "人头", "成员", "槽位", "seat", "seats", "slot", "member"] },
    { "match": ["账户与设置", "Account & Settings"], "terms": ["账户", "账号", "设置", "数据迁移", "导出", "account", "settings", "migrate", "export"] },
